{"id":"conv_02580","context":"Asuka and Mei discuss what a great essay seeks.","ambient":"living_room_quiet","cast":["asuka_teacher","mei_romantic"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"mei_romantic","mood":null,"en":"What does good writing seek?","jp":"良い文章って、何を求めるんでしょう?","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[5,17,26,29,70,93,100,117,237,678,971,1486,2280],"jpTokens":[{"s":"良い","r":"よい","w":237},{"s":"文章","r":"ぶんしょう","w":971},{"s":"って","w":100},{"s":"、"},{"s":"何","r":"なに","w":70},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"求める","r":"もとめる","w":1486},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"でしょ","w":17},{"s":"う","w":29},{"s":"?"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"It seeks to enter deep into the reader's heart.","jp":"読者の心に、深く入ることを求めます。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,5,14,15,242,678,875,1370,1486,1803,2027],"jpTokens":[{"s":"読者","r":"どくしゃ","w":1370},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"心","r":"こころ","w":242},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"、"},{"s":"深く","r":"ふかく","w":1803},{"s":"入る","r":"はいる","w":875},{"s":"こと","w":15},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"求め","r":"もとめ","w":1486},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"mei_romantic","mood":null,"en":"Writing that's logical yet warm is nice.","jp":"論理的かつ、温かい文章がいいですね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[6,17,34,51,81,971,1397,1999,2023,7538,11349,17639],"jpTokens":[{"s":"論理","r":"ろんり","w":2023},{"s":"的","r":"てき","w":34},{"s":"かつ","w":1397},{"s":"、"},{"s":"温かい","r":"あたたかい","w":7538},{"s":"文章","r":"ぶんしょう","w":971},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"いい","w":81},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"However, you mustn't put in too much emotion.","jp":"ただし、感情を入れすぎてもいけません。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[4,5,11,14,26,54,331,383,1261,1330,1341,1374,3181,9856],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ただし","w":1261},{"s":"、"},{"s":"感情","r":"かんじょう","w":1341},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"入れ","r":"いれ","w":1330},{"s":"すぎ","w":1374},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"いけ","w":3181},{"s":"ませ","w":14},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"mei_romantic","mood":null,"en":"I want to put heart into the characters.","jp":"登場する人物に、心を込めたいです。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,5,17,19,62,242,780,1314,4181],"jpTokens":[{"s":"登場","r":"とうじょう","w":780},{"s":"する","w":19},{"s":"人物","r":"じんぶつ","w":1314},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"、"},{"s":"心","r":"こころ","w":242},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"込め","r":"こめ","w":4181},{"s":"たい","w":62},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"Putting life into characters makes the story move.","jp":"人物に命を入れると、物語が動きます。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,5,6,9,14,383,1127,1314,1330,1564,2763],"jpTokens":[{"s":"人物","r":"じんぶつ","w":1314},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"命","r":"いのち","w":1564},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"入れる","r":"いれる","w":1330},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"、"},{"s":"物語","r":"ものがたり","w":1127},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"動き","r":"うごき","w":2763},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"mei_romantic","mood":null,"en":"What readers seek is that life.","jp":"読者が求めるのは、その命ですね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,6,17,33,51,678,1370,1486,1564,1999],"jpTokens":[{"s":"読者","r":"どくしゃ","w":1370},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"求める","r":"もとめる","w":1486},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"、"},{"s":"その","w":33},{"s":"命","r":"いのち","w":1564},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"asuka_teacher","mood":null,"en":"Let's aim for clear yet kind writing.","jp":"明確かつ優しい文章を、目指しましょう。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[5,14,28,29,425,971,1397,1398,1974,2248,2280,2861,3298,3670,5448,7718],"jpTokens":[{"s":"明確","r":"めいかく","w":1398},{"s":"かつ","w":1397},{"s":"優しい","r":"やさしい","w":3670},{"s":"文章","r":"ぶんしょう","w":971},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"、"},{"s":"目指し","r":"めざし","w":2248},{"s":"ましょ","w":14},{"s":"う","w":29},{"s":"。"}]}]}